---
description: Fill-only files with <./…> slots
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: false
---
Files containing `<./` slots are fill-only. Change slot interiors only, through the `dotslot_fill` MCP tool or
`dotslot fill FILE --set name=value -i`. Do not reflow, re-indent or "fix" text outside slots. After editing, run
`dotslot check FILE --git-base HEAD` and revert anything it reports.
